  "note": "Kinkerstraat 265-313 (odd side), one 1992 block of grey-brown brick: 16.4 m bay units, each a recessed loggia with round projecting balconies between two three-storey glazed grid bays, a ribbon window on the top storey, shops behind an arcade under a canopy. The cluster table assigns kinker-1985-infill (auto); the photo matches no library type, so every pand places the infill type with the unit written as overrides (bay widths, six-pane windows, projecting balconies on the loggia axis). Strip 2024-12-11."
 },
